deepseek-harness-plugins README · Capabilities：- discovers flat DSH Markdown skills and complete `SKILL.md` packages;
- applies deterministic structural and security checks before import;
- stores approved packages centrally by SHA-256 without copying them into projects;
- computes effective loadouts as global assignments minus project exclusions plus project and session assignments;
- rejects conflicting approved versions and duplicate invocation names;
- persists stable DSH workspace and session assignments;
- writes and reconciles exact project pins in `.dsh/skills-manager.yaml`;
- registers one cwd-sensitive global DSH provider and Fiber-owned session providers;
- catalogs shipped system skills as trusted, read-only entries;
- creates and continuously verifies immutable managed preset generations;
- archives managed skills non-destructively and performs dependency-aware safe or exact-name-confirmed forced deletion;
- retains a bounded metadata-only audit history and exports JSON-safe inventory metadata;
- exposes a small JSON-safe Typert Remote namespace with revision-bound previews and single-use confirmation tokens;
- adds an additive Skills Manager settings page plus Project

